#: mactrack_view_sites.php
msgid "View IP Ranges"
msgstr "Visa IP-intervall"

#: setup.php
msgid "How long should port MAC details be retained in the database."
msgstr "Hur länge ska uppgifter om portarnas MAC-adresser sparas i databasen?"

#: setup.php
msgid ""
"Should Mactrack perform reverse DNS lookup of the IP addresses associated "
"with ports. CAUTION: If DNS is not properly setup, this will slow scan time "
"significantly."
msgstr ""
"Ska Mactrack göra omvända DNS-uppslagningar av IP-adresser som är kopplade "
"till portar? OBSERVERA: Om DNS inte är korrekt konfigurerat tar skanningen "
"betydligt längre tid."

#: setup.php
msgid ""
"Please enter the DNS timeout in milliseconds. Mactrack uses a PHP based DNS "
"resolver."
msgstr ""
"Ange DNS-tidsgränsen i millisekunder. Mactrack använder en PHP-baserad DNS-"
"uppslagare."

